    },
    {
      "id": "narrator-10brb0g",
      "sha256": "04dc5e5a3e318a75d5069f5f0f15f0d57ef287b28f0edac78c5383c43bff8a5e",
      "hasTranscript": true,
      "heard": "For each claim, point to a line that supports or contradicts it. If no line settles it, choose can't tell.",
      "exactNormalizedMatch": true
    },
    {
      "id": "narrator-11k9rl7",
      "sha256": "fdbe0ff75d76f254efbce16b3770c8c484cd20dcf4c029f74c35a9c691b34af8",
      "hasTranscript": true,
      "heard": "Follow the stages, audit, name the flaw, then fix. We are checking who gets help and who misses out.",
      "exactNormalizedMatch": true
    },
    {
      "id": "narrator-12ov7k6",
      "sha256": "7702dbaa2c7e25f8a8c8a87993a2e7a4c92fc1d156a526cfc738d3eca423a2a9",
      "hasTranscript": true,
      "heard": "Choose every answer, then give my testimony. Read feedback and revise your answer. Your first hint on a new topic is free and keeps your stars. Later hints show their heart cost.",
      "exactNormalizedMatch": true
    },
    {
      "id": "narrator-159uqyc",
      "sha256": "ba8a922b24d5e96a4de2da372d3e233f980bcdbfd5cc6787c58d2dc5861a1090",
      "hasTranscript": true,
      "heard": "Each clue is evidence. Read them all first. Click a clue to mark it as used.",
      "exactNormalizedMatch": true
    },
    {
      "id": "narrator-1bg6pmc",
      "sha256": "c469350382bbb8f5dd7273c44fb7cd60d1eb48288a83d27e333d40b1185c1257",
      "hasTranscript": true,
      "heard": "three acts wonder investigate compare We need a useful question before a calculation.",
      "exactNormalizedMatch": true
    },
    {
      "id": "narrator-1d2kqd2",
      "sha256": "4f450bce5d7b1dee425df30ee1aaf7c75478cd903899f83dd2eace2a82e240f5",
      "hasTranscript": true,
      "heard": "Example: To fill an empty tank at a steady rate, we need its capacity and the amount entering each minute. Its color probably will not help.",
      "exactNormalizedMatch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "narrator-1hajygj",
      "sha256": "ddff52f39b1a898150d1df7a51025d981ec05575866992b5da416b0328d1730b",
      "hasTranscript": true,
      "heard": "Click a cell once for an x, twice for a check. A check crosses out its row and column.",
      "exactNormalizedMatch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "narrator-1vde02a",
      "sha256": "88e6e300b409a2349af09a02d621c2040e4e8f8a6181175dcf65e1839c6d1b2f",
      "hasTranscript": true,
      "heard": "The four boxes count right and wrong decisions. Example, refusing help to someone who needs it is a missed need, even if most other decisions are right.",
      "exactNormalizedMatch": true
    },
    {
      "id": "narrator-1wqrgiv",
      "sha256": "6563cbbb5a5372837ea32a52c90a05a38981376ed9d54fc1939d43b41b395cd0",
      "hasTranscript": true,
      "heard": "Example, not this puzzle. Ada did not write the frog story. Put X where Ada meets that headline.",
      "exactNormalizedMatch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "narrator-3ai2ov",
      "sha256": "45027536ac7898513c38e7f26a57c289ba75e5bb232d982a1a0e1e05d3b38b66",
      "hasTranscript": true,
      "heard": "In the reveal, compare your model with what happened. Explain which assumption caused any gap and complete the reflection. How to play is free. The hint button shows its heart cost. Think first, then check your answer.",
      "exactNormalizedMatch": true
    },
    {
      "id": "narrator-3zek8u",
      "sha256": "0e2e74d09c903792c4e2cd37fb20ceb2de847cc468ce940a6b46f85a891f26fd",
      "hasTranscript": true,
      "heard": "Then check my grid. How to play is free. The hint button shows its heart cost. Think first, then check your answer.",
      "exactNormalizedMatch": true
    },
    {
      "id": "narrator-4a6snp",
      "sha256": "40d914b480d7ee5644e8996c9b7958150b1e4fee79111abf01951d9f93a6163b",
      "hasTranscript": true,
      "heard": "Choose information cards with facts your model needs. Choose a model and use the calculator, table, or graph to find a result.",
      "exactNormalizedMatch": true
    },
    {
      "id": "narrator-5opduz",
      "sha256": "d9961ea8c36009519158cb1bd0db9eab10535192afd24bb054e2fea4990bdd44",
      "hasTranscript": true,
      "heard": "Run the home visit audit. Click cards to see their scores. Compare the stamps with the needs the audit reveals.",
      "exactNormalizedMatch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "narrator-aefnqk",
      "sha256": "386b80caa2ed1d52b6d54ae7a9011e900b720d18c7ec51404b46e207871a144f",
      "hasTranscript": true,
      "heard": "Example: not this scene. A red lamp is on. The red lamp is on is true. The red lamp is off is false.",
      "exactNormalizedMatch": true
    },
    {
      "id": "narrator-ddmjgv",
      "sha256": "3535e00bf03a3a75874aa127438fe3c77ccf167ab5a79f472c536f198774cc09",
      "hasTranscript": true,
      "heard": "Watch the scene, choose what you wonder, then make a rough guess. The guess is a starting point, not a test of your maths.",
      "exactNormalizedMatch": true
    },
    {
      "id": "narrator-esv7pg",
      "sha256": "4527d1a021c6e5bce09c51dba7837cc962ecfb3801a6773096305af7c711ccfa",
      "hasTranscript": true,
      "heard": "Read the scene before judging any claim. We need evidence, not a story your mind fills in.",
      "exactNormalizedMatch": true
    },
    {
      "id": "narrator-fbqsxp",
      "sha256": "47a481c4d392ee88a12e00929a6aedd54a24a9e54211661c4fea130a21c7409f",
      "hasTranscript": true,
      "heard": "In that example, a blue lamp is on is can't tell. There is no evidence either way. Use these three buttons for each claim.",
      "exactNormalizedMatch": true
    },
    {
      "id": "narrator-if4eei",
      "sha256": "fa581adbffb6b94039178487c3c6fc7e9e3f296c036123e5a355f28955dd1e87",
      "hasTranscript": false,
      "heard": null,
      "exactNormalizedMatch": null
    },
    {
      "id": "narrator-rhkszh",
      "sha256": "64c6835e3a6440491590eedc0220a2ce431e8cbcda20ec19e61d739c28216022",
      "hasTranscript": true,
      "heard": "When a row has only one empty cell left, that cell must be a check. Keep going until every row has one check.",
      "exactNormalizedMatch": false
    },
    {
      "id": "narrator-xoykcl",
      "sha256": "e402d7cd4a008d9d6dcedb4cb5513c4e2279298b69d7973359ff1229ec933cdf",
      "hasTranscript": true,
      "heard": "Read the rule and budget, name the flaw, then choose one of the listed fixes to meet the stated goals.",
      "exactNormalizedMatch": true
    },
